{"id":"medida","lemma":"medida","pos":"noun","rank":1815,"glosses":["measurement; measure, gauge","degree, extent","action, step, sanction"],"ipa":"/meˈdida/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"medidas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-medida.wav","formAudio":{"medidas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-medidas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Todo está hecho a la medida.","en":"It's all custom made.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800801"},{"text":"Se requieren medidas inmediatas.","en":"Prompt action is necessary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735624"},{"text":"Debo encargar un nuevo traje a medida.","en":"I must get a new suit made.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692961"},{"text":"La situación exige medidas drásticas.","en":"The situation calls for drastic measures.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537907"},{"text":"Empezó a elevar la voz a medida que hablaba.","en":"Her voice began to rise as she spoke.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693078"}]}